      "message": "I\u0027ve increased the key width of the second row from 8.3% to 8.7%. Additionally, the alignment of the \u0027f\u0027 and \u0027u\u0027 keys is not consistent. Also, the backspace button on the mobile keyboard is not positioned in the first row so X key cannot located at same location.\n\nAlso some for keyboard. X key located at first row. \n\nIn the Turkish-Q layout, the \u0027x\u0027 button is located where the \u0027,\u0027 button is, and the \u0027,\u0027 button is positioned to the left of the space bar. In contrast, for the English layout, the \u0027\u0027\u0027 button is located in the symbols section.\n\nX",
